5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's make this camp amazing! We need to balance the budget and make sure it's easy for everyone to get there. What should we check first?,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely if we could choose a place that brings everyone closer together. I worry that our members have become a bit distant lately.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should be careful about the administrative burden. If the planning is too complex, the organizers will suffer. We need a sustainable choice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want it to be an adventure! But we can't have everyone exhausted. We need to make sure the place is actually comfortable to stay in!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need to be realistic about the costs. I want to ensure we have a precise budget before we announce anything to the members.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I agree! I'm curious about how we've handled the money before. Maybe we should look at the transport receipts and the bed rates?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think it's important to understand how the different year-groups are getting along. Perhaps we can look into the seniors' views on mixing?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look into the workload. I want to know about the cooking duties and the public booking process to avoid burnout.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to find out about the beds and the actual experience of staying there! I'll check the bed rates and the away camp attendance sheets.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will focus on the financial risks. I'll check the transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Sounds like a plan! I'll take the transport receipts and the bed rates too, just to be sure about the fairness of the costs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the attendance sheets. I want to see who actually comes and who might be feeling left out.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll stick to the logistics of the workload. I'll check the canteen closure and the lottery for public bookings.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Wait, I want to know if the rooms are actually good! I'll check the bed rates and the accounts from the inland clubs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, if you're checking receipts, let's coordinate. I'll stick to the whole-building lets and the transport receipts to track the gaps.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Got it! I'll focus on the bed rates and the transport receipts to see if the flat fee is actually fair for everyone.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I'll look into the seniors' views on mixing and the attendance sheets. I hope we can find a way to make everyone feel welcome.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I'm set. I'll investigate the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, and the lottery and application for public group bookings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for the research! I'll check the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds and the accounts from two clubs that went inland.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll handle the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the group transport in three years of receipts. Let's be thorough.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
